{"kind":"data","event":{"type":"file_write_streaming","toolCallId":"01a17b51-8c10-7059-8b58-5dca7dab6738","path":"/home/user/app/README.md","status":"running","chunk":"### Run frontend dev server\n\n```bash\nbun run dev\n```\n\nOpen [http://localhost:5173](http://localhost:5173). Connect an injected EVM wallet (MetaMask, Rabby) on Arc Testnet (chain ID 5042002) to make transactions. Read-only browsing works without a wallet.\n\n### Build frontend\n\n```bash\nbun run build\n```\n\n### Lint and typecheck\n\n```bash\nbun run check\n```\n\n### Frontend routes\n\n| Route | Description |\n|---|---|\n| `/` | Home — live contract stats and how it works |\n| `/employer` | Create shifts, attest hours, cancel |\n| `/worker` | Clock in/out, claim USDC |\n| `/shift/:id` | Full per-shift detail and actions |\n| `/proof` | Read-only shift lookup by ID |\n| `/help` | FAQ and contract reference |\n\n### Environment variables\n\nNone required for building, testing, or running the frontend locally. Deploy requires a funded wallet and an RPC endpoint for Arc Mainnet or Testnet; supply them via Foundry's `--rpc-url` and `--private-key` flags (or environment variables) at deploy time.","oldContent":"### Environment variables\n\nNone required for building and testing locally. Deploy requires a funded wallet and an RPC endpoint for Arc Mainnet or Testnet; supply them via Foundry's `--rpc-url` and `--private-key` flags (or environment variables) at deploy time.","totalLines":34,"oldTotalLines":3}}
{"kind":"data","event":{"type":"tool_call","status":"complete","toolCallId":"01a17b51-8c10-7059-8b58-5dca7dab6738","toolName":"edit_file","args":{"file_path":"/home/user/app/README.md","old_string":"[redacted]","new_string":"[redacted]"},"result":"Successfully replaced 1 occurrence(s) in '/home/user/app/README.md'\n\nResulting context around the edit:\n54\t\n55\tRuns 76 tests: unit matrix (U01-U40), transition matrix (T01-T16), fuzz (rate / duration / attested seconds / random actors), and five Foundry invariants (solvency, totalEscrow sum, owed <= escrow, no double-claim, terminal-state zeroing).\n56\t\n57\t### Run frontend dev server\n58\t\n59\t```bash\n60\tbun run dev\n61\t```\n62\t\n63\tOpen [http://localhost:5173](http://localhost:5173). Connect an injected EVM wallet (MetaMask, Rabby) on Arc Testnet (chain ID 5042002) to make transactions. Read-only browsing works without a wallet.\n64\t\n65\t### Build frontend\n66\t\n... (14 lines not shown) ...\n81\t| `/` | Home — live contract stats and how it works |\n82\t| `/employer` | Create shifts, attest hours, cancel |\n83\t| `/worker` | Clock in/out, claim USDC |\n84\t| `/shift/:id` | Full per-shift detail and actions |\n85\t| `/proof` | Read-only shift lookup by ID |\n86\t| `/help` | FAQ and contract reference |\n87\t\n88\t### Environment variables\n89\t\n90\tNone required for building, testing, or running the frontend locally. Deploy requires a funded wallet and an RPC endpoint for Arc Mainnet or Testnet; supply them via Foundry's `--rpc-url` and `--private-key` flags (or environment variables) at deploy time.\n91\t"}}
